    "OctoRunner and its menu bar item will close. Directly managed runners must be idle before OctoRunner can stop them and quit. Installed runner LaunchAgents continue running through launchd.\n\nImported runners stay under their existing process manager.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OctoRunner and its menu bar item will close. Directly managed runners must be idle before OctoRunner can stop them and quit. Installed runner LaunchAgents continue running through launchd.\n\nImported runners stay under their existing process manager."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OctoRunner und sein Menüleistensymbol werden geschlossen. Direkt verwaltete Runner müssen im Leerlauf sein, damit OctoRunner sie stoppen und sich beenden kann. Installierte Runner-LaunchAgents laufen über launchd weiter.\n\nImportierte Runner bleiben unter ihrer bisherigen Prozessverwaltung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
