    "This runner is currently located at its original folder (%@). Clicking 'Migrate into OctoRunner' copies the runner configuration into OctoRunner's managed Application Support directory, sets up automatic background start on macOS login, and switches management to OctoRunner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This runner is currently located at its original folder (%@). Clicking 'Migrate into OctoRunner' copies the runner configuration into OctoRunner's managed Application Support directory, sets up automatic background start on macOS login, and switches management to OctoRunner."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Runner liegt noch in seinem ursprünglichen Ordner (%@). „Zu OctoRunner migrieren“ kopiert die Runner-Konfiguration in das verwaltete Application-Support-Verzeichnis, richtet den Hintergrundstart bei der macOS-Anmeldung ein und überträgt die Verwaltung an OctoRunner."
          }
        }
